7. **Icon state** — a filled star for favourite, outline star for not. I'll conditionally set the SVG `fill`/stroke classes based on `isFavorite`. This gives clear visual feedback for the toggle. `aria-hidden="true"` on the SVG so screen readers use `aria-label`.

